<p>Hamaare Khwaab Me Jab Syed-E- Abraar aate hai<br />
Mubaarak Baad Dene Taala-E Bedaar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Jigar Me Dard Lab Par Aah Aansoo Dono Aankhou'n Me<br />
Bade Saamaan Se hazrath Ke Matamdaar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Is aane ke fida kis shaan se ran me hussain aaye<br />
yuhi aate hai bas marne ko jo tayyar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Qayaale Shaah-E Waala Me Dil-E Muztar Yeh Kehta Hai<br />
Uth Aye Dard-E Jigar Taazeem Ko Sarkaar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Sawaari Hai Yeh Akbar Ki Ke Qudrath Ka Namoona Hai<br />
Shabaahath Keh Rahi Hai Ahmad-E Mukhtaar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Bade Faiyaaz hai Yeh Rone Waale Bhi Ke Majlis Me<br />
Jab aate hai Lutaane Gowhar-E Shehwaar aate hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Abhi Khaime Se Nikle Bhi Na The Ghul Machgayaa Run Me<br />
